Route30_Interior2_Text_Gentleman_1::
	.string "I’m depending on you!$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Gentleman_2::
	.string "Life is delightful! Always, new\n"
	.string "discoveries to be made!$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Gentleman_3::
	.string "Hm? That SCALE!\n"
	.string "What’s that?\l"
	.string "A red GYARADOS?\p"
	.string "That’s rare!\n"
	.string "I, I want it...\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, would you care to trade it?\n"
	.string "I can offer this EXP.SHARE I got\l"
	.string "from PROF.OAK$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Gentleman_4::
	.string "That’s disappointing. That happens\n"
	.string "to be very rare.$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "Hello, hello!\n"
	.string "You must be {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "PROF.ELM said that you would visit.$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "This is what I want PROF.ELM to\n"
	.string "examine.$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "I know a couple who run a POKéMON\n"
	.string "DAY-CARE service.\p"
	.string "They gave me that EGG.\n"
	.string "I was intrigued, so I sent mail to\l"
	.string "PROF.ELM.\p"
	.string "For POKéMON evolution, PROF.ELM is\n"
	.string "the authority.$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_4::
	.string "Even PROF.OAK here recognizes that.\p"
	.string "If my assumption is correct, PROF.ELM\n"
	.string "will know it.$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_5::
	.string "OAK: Aha! So you’re {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "I’m OAK! A POKéMON researcher.\p"
	.string "I was just visiting my old friend\n"
	.string "MR.POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I heard you were running an errand\n"
	.string "for PROF.ELM, so I waited here.\p"
	.string "Oh! What’s this?\n"
	.string "A rare POKéMON!\p"
	.string "Let’s see...\p"
	.string "Hm, I see!\p"
	.string "I understand why PROF.ELM gave you\n"
	.string "a POKéMON for this errand.\p"
	.string "To researchers like PROF.ELM and I,\n"
	.string "POKéMON are our friends.\p"
	.string "He saw that you would treat your\n"
	.string "POKéMON with love and care.\p"
	.string "Ah!\n"
	.string "You seem to be dependable.\p"
	.string "How would you like to help me out?$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_6::
	.string "See? This is the latest version of\n"
	.string "POKéDEX.\p"
	.string "It automatically records data on\n"
	.string "POKéMON you’ve seen or caught.\l"
	.string "It’s a hi-tech encyclopedia!$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_7::
	.string "{PLAYER} got POKéDEX!$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_8::
	.string "Go meet many kinds of POKéMON and\n"
	.string "complete that POKéDEX!\p"
	.string "But I’ve stayed too long.\n"
	.string "I have to get to GOLDENROD for my\l"
	.string "usual radio show.\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, I’m counting on you!$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_9::
	.string "You are returning to PROF.ELM?\p"
	.string "Here. Your POKéMON should have some\n"
	.string "rest.$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Trigger1_10::
	.string "I’m depending on you!$"

Route30_Interior2_Text_Sign::
	.string "What is this webpage?$"
